title: Witness_Start
---
<<if has_clue("witness_saw_stranger")>>
    Witness: I already told you what I saw. Nothing's changed.
<<else>>
    Witness: I saw someone lurking near the cathedral last night.
    -> Ask about the stranger
        Witness: Tall figure, dark coat. Didn't get a good look at the face.
        <<add_clue "witness_saw_stranger">>
        Witness: That's all I know.
    -> Ask about the cathedral
        Witness: It's been sealed for years. Strange anyone would be near it.
    -> Leave
        Witness: Go on then, detective.
<<endif>>
===
